{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "That's Christmas To Me and Noel connect directly with my repeated Christmas listening, making them feel like natural choices when I want more holiday music.",
    "Under the Influence connects with my recent interest in Straight No Chaser through The New Old Fashioned, giving me a reason to consider it beyond the holiday theme."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Adele and a hits collection do not connect clearly enough with the holiday music and vocal groups I have been choosing to make me want to listen now.",
    "Titles such as Partners, Hope and Closer give me too little evidence of a connection, while Stages points toward show tunes that I am not currently seeking."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "The selections seem to assume that enjoying these albums means I want a broader range of popular vocal music, but that connection is too loose for me.",
    "A familiar album or a collection of hits seems to count as a reason to try something, whereas I need a clearer link to my own recent listening."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My repeated Christmas choices show a specific interest in holiday music, rather than just a general interest in singers or albums.",
    "My latest choice, The New Old Fashioned, makes another Straight No Chaser album relevant even without a Christmas theme; I would consider it later, although I would choose only one album this visit."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognized my holiday listening and some vocal-group interest, but stretched that interest too broadly to music I have little reason to choose now."
}"}
